  "title": "Celebrating Five Years of Sprott Physical Uranium Trust (SPUT)",
  "summary": "Five years ago, the Sprott Physical Uranium Trust (TSX U.U), or fondly \"SPUT\", began a new chapter in uranium investing. Since launching in July 2021, SPUT has become the world's largest physical uranium fund, providing investors with a transparent, exchange-listed vehicle that offers exposure to physical uranium without the operational risks associated with uranium mining companies.",
